Breaks: querencia-dateien (<< 0.2.0)
Description: Querencia Desktop panel, desktop, themes and backgrounds (alpha)
 Querencia Desktop is a classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2 /
 Ubuntu 10.04, written in Rust with GTK 4 for Wayland (labwc).
 .
 This package contains the shell programs:
  * querencia-panel: top panel with the Applications, Places and System
    menus, clock, volume and network applets; bottom panel with window
    list and workspace switcher;
  * querencia-desktop: desktop background, desktop icons (including
    mounted volumes) and the desktop context menu;
  * querencia-lautstaerke: volume control (PulseAudio API, e.g. PipeWire);
  * querencia-netzwerk: network state for the applet (NetworkManager,
    read-only fallback for systemd-networkd);
  * querencia-kuerzel: overview of the keyboard shortcuts (Super+?);
 the theme Querencia-Klassisch for labwc, GTK 4 and GTK 3 (with the dark
 window frame Querencia-Klassisch-Dunkel for labwc), the default desktop
 backgrounds and the German translations of panel and desktop, including
 those of the libraries querencia-oberflaeche and querencia-dateiarbeit,
 which the file manager Querencia Dateien shares.
 .
 They need a wlroots compositor with the layer-shell protocol and are
 normally started by querencia-session.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
